# Sprint 2 Step 8 — trim build context. test-results/ is ~383 MB of
# Playwright screenshots + traces from local dev runs; never needed in
# the production image.
#
# NOTE: tests/ and docs/ MUST stay in the context — scripts/measure-resetdb.ts
# does `await import("../tests/util/db")` and Next.js's tsc pass will fail
# to resolve the module if tests/ is excluded. The runtime cost is ~5 MB.
